# Milestone 2 (X4): the forge integration on the feature-rich fixture. Everything runs through the real code paths
# (forge detection, refresh, badge map, Accounts page, create pull request dialog, sign-in dialogs) against a fake
# GitHub Enterprise server on loopback with an in-memory keychain: nothing leaves the machine and no real keychain
# entry is written. Compare with 21 section 5.4 and 5.5.
resize 1280x720
set theme dark
open repository rich
wait idle
# A fake forge with two pull requests (an open one with passing checks, a draft with running checks); origin of the
# repository points at it. The branch docs/rewrite has no pull request.
forge mock start feature/login=open:passed fix/typo=draft:running
wait idle
forge mock sign in
wait idle
assert forge status idle
assert forge badge feature/login open passed
assert forge badge fix/typo draft running
assert forge badge docs/rewrite none
shot m2-forge-01-badges
# The branch menus: Open pull request, Create pull request.
open context menu branch feature/login at 120 190
wait idle
shot m2-forge-02-menu-open-pr
close menu
open context menu branch docs/rewrite at 120 230
wait idle
shot m2-forge-03-menu-create-pr
close menu
# The create pull request dialog (the branch has no upstream: "Push the branch first").
open dialog pull-request docs/rewrite
wait idle
shot m2-forge-04-create-pr
close dialog
# A merge on the forge shows as a merged badge after the next refresh.
forge mock merge feature/login
wait idle
assert forge badge feature/login merged
shot m2-forge-05-merged
# The Accounts page and the sign-in dialogs.
open settings page accounts
wait idle
shot m2-forge-06-accounts
close dialog
open forge dialog device
wait idle
shot m2-forge-07-device-flow
close dialog
open forge dialog enterprise
wait idle
shot m2-forge-08-token-dialog
close dialog
# Offline: the badges stay (from the cache), the tooltips say so, polling backs off.
forge mock offline on
forge refresh
wait idle
assert forge status offline
assert forge badge fix/typo draft running
shot m2-forge-09-offline
set theme light
wait idle
shot m2-forge-10-light
set theme dark
assert no error
